description:
Susun output empat perbandingan. AND ditulis && dan hanya true jika kedua syarat benar.

```java
public class TraceBooleanComparisons {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        int value = 7;
        System.out.println("Above: " + (value > 5));
        System.out.println("Even: " + (value % 2 == 0));
        System.out.println("Inside: " + (value >= 3 && value <= 9));
        System.out.println("Equal: " + (value == 9));
    }
}
```
